sanctioned: this program drives the codec-derived Ipe.Db.Store WHERE-based mutation surface — Store.updateWhere and Store.deleteWhere (each lowering a typed Cond to an audited SqlFragment against the store's own columns), plus the defaultText / defaultInt / touchOnUpdate DDL column specs — over an in-memory SQLite database via Db.open + Db.withTransaction. Ipê emits Rust+sqlx; the Store mutation surface and the SqlFragment-typed WHERE path are Ipê-only additions with no reference-backend counterpart, so the divergence is structural. Ipê's own verified output is recorded as the reference.
